  "description_snippet": "## VULNERABILITY DETAILS\n\n### Summary\n\nA malicious extension can use the `chrome.debugger.sendCommand` API with the `Page.navigate` CDP command to navigate to `view-source:file:` URLs without the user enabling `Allow access to file URLs`. On Windows, this can be exploited using a UNC path to leak NT"
